OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss vows to expel racists
OL,4,Aand misogynists
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows accusations the force failed
OL,7,Fto investigate serving and former
OL,8,Fofficers for domestic abuse and sexual
OL,9,Fviolence and its payment of
OL,10,Fcompensation to women who claimed they
OL,11,Fwere victims.
OL,13,FSince the BBC reported the claims from
OL,14,Fthe nine women, a former female officer
OL,15,Fhas also alleged she was sexually
OL,16,Fassaulted by a colleague on a work
OL,17,Ftrip.
